---
title: Sequence — Capital Flow · Market Data · Borrowing Limit
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
    note over LB,WB: (a) Hierarchical capital + reserve-ratio gates
    participant LB as Local Bank
    participant NB as National Bank
    participant WB as World Bank
    LB->>NB: allocateCapital request
    NB->>WB: reserve ratio validation
    WB-->>NB: approved allocation
    NB-->>LB: capital credited
  end

  rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
    note over CL,DB: (b) Market data — cached Chainlink feeds
    participant CL as Chainlink Feed
    participant EL as Event Listener
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    CL->>EL: latestRoundData
    EL->>DB: CHAINLINK_PRICE_ROUND cache
  end

  rect rgb(232, 240, 254)
    note over API,SC: (c) Borrowing limit — SBT read before ML score
    participant API as Express API
    participant SBT as CreditPassport
    participant ML as FastAPI ML
    participant SC as LocalBank SC
    API->>SBT: getScore wallet
    API->>ML: features + passport tier
    API->>SC: updateBorrowingLimit if changed
  end
